  "notes": "Form 1040 line 12d, the Spouse box (Spouse is blind). Publishes 'not_checked' from the recorded spouse_blind answer only on a joint return, or a separate return whose spouse_separate_condition is yes. Head of household, qualifying surviving spouse and single are inapplicable."
